---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SectionHeader from "../components/SectionHeader.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Bungac Engine | Syntheion Dynamics"
  description="Custom C# engine and level editor for immersive sim horror development."
  mode="engine"
  sector="Engine"
  ogImage="/images/mini-engine-editor.jpg"
>
  <section class="section container">
    <SectionHeader sector="Core" title="Bungac Engine + Editor" subtitle="C# custom engine stack in active development." />
    <div class="grid-2">
      <img class="enlargeable" src="/images/mini-engine-editor.jpg" alt="Bungac level editor view" />
      <img class="enlargeable" src="/images/mini-engine-3d-models.jpg" alt="Engine gameplay with imported 3D models" />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <SectionHeader sector="Pivot Story" title="From FPS experiment to immersive sim horror" />
    <p>
      The original goal was to build a custom FPS engine. Once the first atmosphere pass started to work, the project
      naturally pivoted into immersive sim horror territory. That shift became the identity of the whole toolchain.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <SectionHeader sector="Capabilities" title="What it can do right now" />
    <ul>
      <li>Custom C# runtime and rendering pipeline</li>
      <li>Own level editor with chunk workflow and entity placement</li>
      <li>AI actors for drones and security patterns</li>
      <li>Interactive world entities such as pickups, doors, triggers, and terminals</li>
      <li>3D model integration for scene building and atmosphere iteration</li>
      <li>Combat-space iteration and mission room prototyping</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section container">
    <SectionHeader sector="Gallery" title="Engine snapshots" />
    <div class="grid-2">
      <img class="enlargeable" src="/images/mini-engine-enemies.jpg" alt="Engine enemies and combat scenario" />
      <img class="enlargeable" src="/images/mini-engine-psionics.jpg" alt="Engine psionics scene" />
    </div>
    <div class="panel" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
      <p><strong>Status:</strong> active internal development. Main focus is atmosphere quality and systemic gameplay depth.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
